<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/13th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Scottish–Norwegian War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1262">1262</a>–<a href="/years/1266">1266</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Scottish–Norwegian War was fought from 1262 to 1266 between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alexander-iii-of-scotland">Alexander III of Scotland</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/haakon-iv-of-norway">Haakon IV of Norway</a> over the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hebrides">Hebrides</a> and the Isle of Man. Haakon's great expedition of 1263 ended indecisively at Largs, and he died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/orkney">Orkney</a> soon after; by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-perth">Treaty of Perth</a> (1266) <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/norway">Norway</a> ceded the Hebrides and Man to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/scotland">Scotland</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/scottish-norwegian-war.jpg" alt="Scottish–Norwegian War" width="320" height="448" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: William Hole · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Battle_of_Largs_(Viking_ships_detail),_1263.JPG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
